Package: com.guacforlife.reynarddefault
Name: ReynardDefault
Version: 1.6.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Redirects browser URL opens to Reynard with per-app control (pick redirect sources in Reynard's settings; quick Safari/Chrome/Firefox/Brave switches in system Settings). Inline toggles, no preference bundle; iPadOS 15.x compatible.
Maintainer: TsangAsuna
Author: guacforlife
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Recommends: com.opa334.ccsupport
Homepage: https://github.com/TsangAsuna/ReynardDefaultBrowser
